  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ecotourism Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to enable TINFI to improve the existing tourist attractions in thevillage to meet the demand for tourist lodging and increase the villages revenues. TINFI will use the funds to create simple lodging facilities for tourists; develop a catering service based on local foods; and organize touring services around the waterfalls of Tanongou.</narrative>
  </description>
